return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'WordPress.com - Big Sky','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-16T17:25:54+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-09 11:57:59+0000','x-generator'=>'GlotPress/2.4.0-alpha','messages'=>['Here is the visible area of the canvas. Photographs are shown as flat placeholder boxes at their real size, so treat any grey rectangle as an image that is present, not as a missing one.'=>'以下是画布的可见区域。 照片按其实际尺寸显示为扁平化占位符框，因此请将任何灰色矩形视为已存在的图片，而非缺少的图片。','Here is the canvas around %d block(s). Photographs are shown as flat placeholder boxes at their real size, so treat any grey rectangle as an image that is present, not as a missing one.'=>'以下是围绕 %d 个区块的画布。 照片按其实际尺寸显示为扁平化占位符框，因此请将任何灰色矩形视为已存在的图片，而非缺少的图片。','Here is the whole page, top to bottom. It is scaled down to fit, so body text will not be legible — read it for colour, type scale, spacing and section rhythm, and take an ordinary picture of a specific area when wording or fine detail matters. Photographs are shown as flat placeholder boxes at their real size.'=>'以下是整页内容，从上到下。 它已按比例缩小以适应版面，因此正文文本可能无法辨认— 请将其用于观察配色、字体大小、间距及版块节奏；当需要看清具体文字或细节时，请再针对某一区域单独拍一张正常尺寸的照片。 照片按其实际尺寸显示为扁平化占位符框。','I couldn\'t get a picture of the canvas just now.'=>'我刚才无法截取画布的画面。','Takes a picture of the editor canvas as it currently renders, including unsaved changes. Use it to check how the page actually looks when the block data alone cannot answer that — after changing styles, colours, spacing or CSS, or whenever a reported problem is visual. Pass fullPage to see the whole page at once, which is what a theme or global styles change needs checking against. Photographs are replaced by flat placeholder boxes at their real size.'=>'截取编辑器画布当前的渲染画面，包括未保存的更改。 当仅凭区块数据无法确定页面实际显示效果时（例如在更改样式、颜色、间距或 CSS 之后，或者每当报告的问题属于视觉类问题时），请使用此功能进行检查。 传递 fullPage 参数即可一次性查看整个页面，更改主题或全局样式时需要以此作为对照基准。 照片将替换为按实际尺寸显示的扁平化占位符框。','Capture Canvas'=>'截取画布','Are there any changes you would like me to make?'=>