 键退出。','Annotation %1$d: %2$s'=>'批注 %1$d：%2$s','%1$s, block %2$d of %3$d'=>'%1$s，区块 %2$d/%3$d','Navigation items not found: %s. These are not in the menu or in the current page structure, so there is nothing to reorder them from — they are most likely from an earlier turn, or the header is not part of the page currently open in the editor. Read the page structure again and use the clientIds it returns, or identify each item by its url or label instead. This reorder was not applied.'=>'未找到导航项目：%s。 这些项目既不在菜单中，也不在当前页面结构中，因此无法从中对它们进行重新排序 — 它们很可能是来自之前的操作步骤，或者该页眉不属于当前在编辑器中打开的页面。 请重新读取页面结构，并使用其返回的 clientId，或者改用 url 或标签来标识每个项目。 此次重新排序未被应用。','Your WordPress.com AI agent that helps with site setup, content, design, and more.'=>'您的 WordPress.com AI 智能体，可协助您完成站点设置、内容创作、设计等工作。','WordPress Agent'=>'WordPress 智能体','Invalid editor path. look up the numeric id from <site_pages>, then retry navigation with the numeric editor_path.'=>'编辑器路径无效。请从 <site_pages> 中查找数字 ID，然后使用该数字 editor_path 重新尝试导航。','Invalid editor path. Page navigation requires /page/{numeric-id}. Look up the page ID first.'=>'编辑器路径无效。 页面导航需要 /page/{numeric-id}。 首先查找页面 ID。','Saves everything and navigates to the specified path in the editor. For page navigation, path must be a numeric editor path like "/page/123" or "page/123"; full URLs, slugs, "all-pages", and paths like "/visit" or "/page/visit" are invalid. If the user names a page and the current page is not the target, look up the numeric id from <site_pages> first, then navigate with the numeric editor path.'=>'保存所有内容，并在编辑器中导航到指定路径。 对于页面导航，路径必须为数字编辑器路径，例如“/page/123”或“page/123”；完整 URL、别名、“all-pages”以及诸如“/visit”或“/page/visit”的路径均无效。 如果用户指定了一个页面，而当前页面并非目标页面，则先从 <site_pages> 中查找数字 ID，然后使用该数字编辑器路径进行导航。','I did not restore that checkpoint because it may replace or remove too much current content.'=>'我没有恢复该检查点，因为这可能会替换或移除太多当前内容。','Restores editor state from a checkpoint associated with a previous mutating tool call. Use for undo/redo requests. Prefer checkpointId values from clientContext.availableCheckpoints whose toolId matches the user intent: block-edit checkpoints for content changes, theme-update checkpoints for style/theme changes, and navigation/entity checkpoints for navigation/entity changes. For undo, use the checkpointId for the most recent relevant non-restore mutating Big Sky tool call. Only use a checkpoint whose toolId is big_sky__restore_checkpoint for explicit redo requests, because those checkpoints represent the state before a prior undo/restore. Pass requestIntentType to describe the user intent: "undo" for undo requests, "redo" for redo requests, or "restore" when restoring a specific checkpoint/version. The checkpoint ID usually starts with "toolu_". Do not use the current restore-checkpoint call ID, any id starting with "call_", a tool name/id, or calypsoCheckpointId/messageId. If the user reports missing homepage/footer/navigation content, do not rebuild or redesign unless the user explicitly agrees; try a relevant checkpoint, WordPress revisions, or support escalation instead.'=>'从与上一个变异工具调用关联的检查点恢复编辑器状态。 用于撤消/重做请求。 优先使用 clientContext.availableCheckpoints 中 toolId 与用户意图匹配的 checkpointId 值：内容更改对应 block-edit 检查点，样式/主题更改对应 theme-update 检查点，导航/实体更改对应 navigation/entity 检查点。 要撤消，请使用最近一次相关的非恢复性变异 Big Sky 工具调用的 checkpointId。 对于显式重做请求，仅使用 toolId 为 big_sky__restore_checkpoint 的检查点，因为这些检查点代表了先前撤销/恢复操作之前的状态。 传递 requestIntentType 来描述用户意图：“undo”表示撤销请求，“redo”表示重做请求，“restore”表示恢复特定检查点/版本。 检查点 ID 通常以“toolu_”开头。 请勿使用当前的 restore-checkpoint 调用 ID、任何以“call_”开头的 ID、工具名称/ID 或 calypsoCheckpointId/messageId。 如果用户报告主页/页脚/导航内容缺失，除非用户明确同意，否则不要重建或重新设计；请尝试恢复相关的检查点、WordPress 修订版本，或升级至技术支持。','The editor is still loading. Try the page design again once the page is editable.'=>'编辑器仍在加载中。 待页面进入可编辑状态后，请再次尝试页面设计。','The generated page content has been staged in the editor for review.'=>'生成的页面内容已暂存在编辑器中，以供审核。','Stream Page Design'=>'流式页面设计','The requested changes were already applied.'=>'所请求的更改已应用。','Open Help Center'=>'打开帮助中心','Get help'=>'获取帮助